  "body_html": "<h1>deviate_of_ne</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\n@[simp] theorem deviate_of_ne (σ : G.Profile) (i : N) (s' : G.strategy i) {j : N} (h : j ≠ i) : deviate σ i s' j = σ j</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Profile</li>\n<li>BehaviorProfile</li>\n<li>BehaviorStrategy</li>\n<li>Mark.other</li>\n<li>Profile</li>\n<li>Strategy</li>\n</ul>",
